+/// Maximum number of atlases representable by [`pack_image_params`]'s 8-bit `atlas_index` field
+/// (bits 6-13). An `atlas_index` of exactly this value would carry into bit 14 (`is_external`),
+/// silently misinterpreting an atlas-backed image as an external texture - see
+/// [`MemorySettings::normalize`], which clamps [`AtlasConfig::max_atlases`] to this value so that
+/// no real atlas allocation can ever produce an out-of-range `atlas_index`.
+///
+/// [`AtlasConfig::max_atlases`]: vello_common::multi_atlas::AtlasConfig::max_atlases
+pub(crate) const MAX_PACKED_ATLAS_COUNT: usize = 256;
+
 /// Pack image `quality`, extend modes, `atlas_index`, and source type into a single u32.
